msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"*pant* *pant* You're... gonna be sorry! Just you wait! Next time, you're "
"toast!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Thank you so much. I really owe you for stepping in like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Don't mention it. Listening to that nice song of yours was all the thanks I "
"needed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Oh, you mean \"The Rose Balsam\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"I learned that song from my grandmother when she first taught me how to "
"play the sanshin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"With your parents' counsel as your compass, with virtue as your shield, you "
"can face this world with a will as strong as steel..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"All of my grandmother's life lessons are right there in the lyrics. I bet "
"that's why it's the first one she had me learn how to play."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "It's a beautiful song."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"I agree... And it's even more important to me nowadays. My grandmother... "
"She passed away last year."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"She once told me that music is all I have, so the kindness of strangers is "
"all I can rely on to make my way in the world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"I sing that song in her memory so that I never forget the lessons she "
"taught me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Sounds like she'd be proud of you. Hang in there, all right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"I'll do my best. Thanks again for your help. Oh, and... here. Please take "
"this. It's an Okinawan delicacy, kind of like a donut."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Sata Andagi<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Thanks to you, I can keep singing here, sharing my grandmother's song with "
"everyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Keep it up. I'll be cheering you on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

